520 8  Call Ampersand Response' is a collaborative artwork made 
       of images exchanged via email. Over a period of several 
       months, Dumontier and Lexier sustained an image-based 
       correspondence by sending each other scans of book covers,
       found objects, drawings and illustrations belonging to 
       each artist's respective collection. The project is based 
       on the idea that their collections speak of their shared 
       artistic affinities while informing their practices. Two 
       rules dictated their conduct: each image was to function 
       as a 'call' seeking a 'response' from the other artist, 
       and the dialogue was to end when an image recalling the 
       project's opening image emerged, thereby constituting a 
       narrative loop. Exhibition: Artexte Gallery, Montreal, 
       Canada (7.6.-8.9.2012). 
